1
00:01:39,425 --> 00:01:41,665
Sir. Parents are gathering out there.

2
00:01:49,305 --> 00:01:51,385
It's been 22 days!

3
00:01:51,985 --> 00:01:53,545
My son, Hong Jinyang,

4
00:01:53,625 --> 00:01:56,705
is still nowhere to be seen!

5
00:01:57,305 --> 00:01:59,505
I only have one child.

6
00:01:59,585 --> 00:02:03,465
What am I going to do
if something happens to him?

7
00:02:04,105 --> 00:02:05,425
My son…

8
00:02:05,505 --> 00:02:06,345
It has been…

9
00:02:07,385 --> 00:02:08,345
Officer!

10
00:02:08,425 --> 00:02:10,185
-Officer.
-Where is my child?

11
00:02:10,265 --> 00:02:11,945
Please. Officer!

12
00:02:12,025 --> 00:02:12,745
Don't do that.

13
00:02:12,825 --> 00:02:13,745
Please.

14
00:02:13,825 --> 00:02:15,145
-Find my child.
-Everyone.

15
00:02:15,225 --> 00:02:17,145
Everyone. Please calm down.

16
00:02:17,225 --> 00:02:18,785
We are as anxious as you.

17
00:02:18,865 --> 00:02:21,185
We haven't slept for a few days.

18
00:02:21,265 --> 00:02:25,065
Creating a ruckus here
is not going to solve the problem, is it?

19
00:02:25,145 --> 00:02:26,705
-Go. Tear it down.
-Okay.

20
00:02:27,385 --> 00:02:29,585
-No! Don't!
-Who dares to tear it down!

21
00:02:29,665 --> 00:02:30,625
No!

22
00:02:30,705 --> 00:02:32,185
Who said you could tear it down?

23
00:02:38,585 --> 00:02:39,865
Keep the posters up.

24
00:02:41,945 --> 00:02:43,225
Will tearing the posters down
solve the problem?

25
00:02:44,585 --> 00:02:46,065
Will it locate the children?

26
00:02:46,145 --> 00:02:49,505
Citizens can post whatever they want.

27
00:02:51,145 --> 00:02:53,025
Use your expertise

28
00:02:54,625 --> 00:02:56,425
if you want to bring the posters down.

29
00:03:02,025 --> 00:03:03,145
My fellow parents.

30
00:03:05,545 --> 00:03:06,385
I am Zhao Jie,

31
00:03:06,465 --> 00:03:07,425
Captain of the Criminal Department
in Nanshan Branch.

32
00:03:08,425 --> 00:03:11,545
Today, I will give you my word

33
00:03:12,265 --> 00:03:13,545
that within seven days,

34
00:03:13,625 --> 00:03:16,585
we will solve the case
and give you an answer.

35
00:03:18,185 --> 00:03:19,465
If we fail to do so,

36
00:03:21,425 --> 00:03:22,385
I will step down.

37
00:03:23,305 --> 00:03:24,705
I'll take your word for it.

38
00:03:24,785 --> 00:03:25,665
Thank you so much!

39
00:03:26,265 --> 00:03:28,265
-No need to do this.
-Please.

40
00:03:29,425 --> 00:03:30,625
Thank you.

41
00:03:34,025 --> 00:03:36,265
MISSING PERSON

42
00:03:43,345 --> 00:03:45,785
WEIYANG PUBLIC
SECURITY BUREAU NANSHAN BRANCH

43
00:03:45,865 --> 00:03:47,545
FAIR AND JUST, LOYAL AND TRUE

44
00:03:47,625 --> 00:03:48,625
MISSING PERSONS SPECIAL TASK FORCE

45
00:03:48,705 --> 00:03:50,385
We have questioned everyone
from the illegal internet cafe

46
00:03:50,465 --> 00:03:51,585
in Yuanlongli.

47
00:03:51,665 --> 00:03:54,105
None of the 18 are under suspicion.

48
00:03:56,585 --> 00:03:59,185
All five teenagers went missing
after they skipped classes.

49
00:03:59,785 --> 00:04:00,865
Three of them

50
00:04:00,945 --> 00:04:03,905
last appeared
at the illegal internet cafe.

51
00:04:03,985 --> 00:04:05,625
The victims don't know each other.

52
00:04:05,705 --> 00:04:06,745
They couldn't possibly have

53
00:04:06,825 --> 00:04:07,945
planned together to go
missing voluntarily.

54
00:04:08,025 --> 00:04:09,385
One of them was injured

55
00:04:10,145 --> 00:04:11,185
and is currently traumatized.

56
00:04:11,265 --> 00:04:14,385
We can basically conclude
that it's a serial kidnapping case.

57
00:04:15,265 --> 00:04:16,985
Captain Zhao made a promise yesterday.

58
00:04:17,585 --> 00:04:19,105
We only have seven days.

59
00:04:19,184 --> 00:04:20,545
We must find

60
00:04:20,624 --> 00:04:21,745
these kids within seven days,
even if we have

61
00:04:21,825 --> 00:04:22,705
to turn the entire city upside down.

62
00:04:23,825 --> 00:04:25,465
Good. Speak.

63
00:04:25,545 --> 00:04:28,105
Captain Qu. If this is the doing
of a serial kidnapper,

64
00:04:28,185 --> 00:04:31,265
can we release a statement to the school

65
00:04:31,345 --> 00:04:34,185
clarifying that Han Zi'ang
is the victim of the kidnapping,

66
00:04:34,265 --> 00:04:37,585
and he only attacked someone
out of fear and shock?

67
00:04:38,145 --> 00:04:38,985
You there.

68
00:04:40,785 --> 00:04:41,825
Handle this matter.

69
00:04:42,785 --> 00:04:43,745
Yes, sir!

70
00:04:44,665 --> 00:04:45,785
Let's circle back.

71
00:04:47,105 --> 00:04:50,785
Captain Zhao wants us
to submit a new investigation plan.

72
00:04:52,305 --> 00:04:55,425
Let's work together and brainstorm.

73
00:04:57,705 --> 00:04:59,025
You can still take more pawns.

74
00:05:03,425 --> 00:05:05,665
-Dad.
-That's right.

75
00:05:05,745 --> 00:05:06,865
Hey.

76
00:05:10,105 --> 00:05:11,145
So?

77
00:05:11,225 --> 00:05:12,705
Got your assignment?

78
00:05:13,945 --> 00:05:15,585
Nothing.

79
00:05:15,665 --> 00:05:16,825
Other than a few side-eyes.

80
00:05:18,345 --> 00:05:22,105
Qu Dahai doesn't have
what it takes to solve cases.

81
00:05:22,185 --> 00:05:24,705
He learned a few tricks from Ran
and began to show off.

82
00:05:25,425 --> 00:05:27,625
Sooner or later,
he'll lead the case to a dead end.

83
00:05:27,705 --> 00:05:29,385
We're having an emergency.

84
00:05:29,465 --> 00:05:30,665
Stop saying something unhelpful.

85
00:05:31,425 --> 00:05:34,305
But Ran's theory is still useful.

86
00:05:35,985 --> 00:05:37,505
Everything has a center.

87
00:05:37,585 --> 00:05:38,745
And outside the center,
there will be ripples.

88
00:05:39,865 --> 00:05:42,185
Dad. I've read the book thrice.

89
00:05:42,265 --> 00:05:43,705
What are you getting at?

90
00:05:47,705 --> 00:05:52,145
CHAPTER 2: "EYE OF THE VORTEX THEORY"

91
00:05:56,465 --> 00:05:58,385
To see the eye of the vortex,

92
00:05:58,465 --> 00:06:00,265
you must be part of it.

93
00:06:03,065 --> 00:06:04,745
The Eye of the Vortex Theory.

94
00:06:08,305 --> 00:06:09,585
Officer He,

95
00:06:09,665 --> 00:06:12,025
I don't know anything
about investigations.

96
00:06:12,105 --> 00:06:15,065
But allow me to thank you
on behalf of the school.

97
00:06:15,145 --> 00:06:16,785
If you hadn't defended

98
00:06:16,865 --> 00:06:18,625
Han Zi'ang this relentlessly,

99
00:06:18,705 --> 00:06:21,185
this turn of events
wouldn't have occurred at all.

100
00:06:21,265 --> 00:06:24,745
Right now, the students
and the parents no longer view Han Zi'ang

101
00:06:24,825 --> 00:06:27,105
as a problematic student,

102
00:06:27,185 --> 00:06:29,665
but as a hero who fought
against the kidnapper.

103
00:06:31,265 --> 00:06:32,105
Principal Qin.

104
00:06:32,185 --> 00:06:34,745
I still need your help
to identify the culprit.

105
00:06:34,825 --> 00:06:36,025
Me?

106
00:06:37,585 --> 00:06:38,665
DANFENG MIDDLE SCHOOL

107
00:07:08,865 --> 00:07:09,745
Class, stand!

108
00:07:10,745 --> 00:07:14,705
-Good morning, sir.
-Sit down.

109
00:07:15,385 --> 00:07:16,865
Open your geometry textbooks.

110
00:07:16,945 --> 00:07:19,145
<i>Let's have a recap</i>
<i>of what we learned previously.</i>

111
00:07:21,745 --> 00:07:25,385
Bye, sir.

112
00:07:25,465 --> 00:07:26,865
Bye.

113
00:07:32,145 --> 00:07:34,785
Miss, are you role-playing as Han Zi'ang?

114
00:07:34,865 --> 00:07:36,065
Yes.

115
00:07:36,145 --> 00:07:37,705
He isn't as spirited as you are.

116
00:07:37,785 --> 00:07:39,625
He spends half of his day sleeping.

117
00:07:39,705 --> 00:07:41,425
Then what does he do
for the rest of his day?

118
00:07:41,505 --> 00:07:43,825
Reading comics. His mind
lives in another dimension.

119
00:07:44,425 --> 00:07:46,025
Xuan. Over here.

120
00:07:46,785 --> 00:07:49,025
Han Zi'ang is a weirdo, right?

121
00:07:49,105 --> 00:07:51,585
Yes. We can't understand
what he says at all.

122
00:07:51,665 --> 00:07:53,745
I think he's obsessed with a cosplayer.

123
00:07:53,825 --> 00:07:54,985
He even said he'd attend
a comic convention

124
00:07:55,065 --> 00:07:56,345
in Shanghai during summer break.

125
00:07:58,145 --> 00:07:59,905
No need to search online.
His interest has changed.

126
00:07:59,985 --> 00:08:01,625
He is now a fan of an anime.

127
00:08:02,305 --> 00:08:05,345
Right. He loves… What is she called again?

128
00:08:06,105 --> 00:08:07,505
Nangong…

129
00:08:08,185 --> 00:08:09,105
This one here.

130
00:08:13,905 --> 00:08:15,305
Yes! Nangong Xuanyue.

131
00:08:15,385 --> 00:08:16,225
NANGONG XUANYUE

132
00:08:19,065 --> 00:08:21,865
TOGETHER FOR YOUR HEALTH
UNITED IN TRUST AND CARE

133
00:08:21,945 --> 00:08:23,065
Drink some water.

134
00:08:31,305 --> 00:08:34,345
Everyone at school
knows you're the victim.

135
00:08:34,425 --> 00:08:35,904
Principal Qin said you were very brave.

136
00:08:35,985 --> 00:08:38,904
They are looking forward to your return.

137
00:08:38,985 --> 00:08:40,144
Ang.

138
00:08:40,985 --> 00:08:43,024
Do you hear me?

139
00:09:25,625 --> 00:09:26,825
Xuanyue.

140
00:09:28,865 --> 00:09:29,865
You've come back.

141
00:09:41,305 --> 00:09:42,425
He Xiaohe!

142
00:09:42,505 --> 00:09:43,945
-Calm down.
-He Xiaohe!

143
00:09:44,025 --> 00:09:45,145
-He Xiaohe!
-You can't go in.

144
00:09:45,945 --> 00:09:46,945
-You can't enter.
-Let me.

145
00:09:47,025 --> 00:09:48,905
You can't enter.
There's no one else inside.

146
00:09:48,985 --> 00:09:50,505
We've brought everyone out.

147
00:09:50,585 --> 00:09:52,425
Please calm down.
We've brought everyone out.

148
00:09:52,505 --> 00:09:54,985
POLICE

149
00:10:05,945 --> 00:10:07,425
Uncle Ran.

150
00:10:07,505 --> 00:10:08,665
Are you injured?

151
00:10:15,825 --> 00:10:17,265
Keyboard!

152
00:10:17,345 --> 00:10:18,505
Keyboard…

153
00:10:19,665 --> 00:10:20,625
Where were you?

154
00:10:21,305 --> 00:10:22,145
Hey!

155
00:10:22,745 --> 00:10:24,065
She was at my place.

156
00:10:24,705 --> 00:10:25,545
Who are you?

157
00:10:26,585 --> 00:10:28,225
Why was she at your place?
What did you do to her?

158
00:10:28,305 --> 00:10:29,905
-She clung to me!
-Tell me!

159
00:10:30,465 --> 00:10:31,545
-What did you do to her?
-Stop!

160
00:10:31,625 --> 00:10:33,585
-Let go!
-Do you know how old she is?

161
00:10:33,665 --> 00:10:34,705
Let go…

162
00:10:35,465 --> 00:10:36,465
What is wrong with you?

163
00:10:36,545 --> 00:10:38,665
-He's my friend, not a criminal!
-Come.

164
00:10:38,745 --> 00:10:39,865
Come back with me.

165
00:10:41,145 --> 00:10:43,425
-Come!
-No! Let go of me!

166
00:10:43,505 --> 00:10:45,025
I won't come back with you.

167
00:10:45,105 --> 00:10:46,625
You don't even know what happened.

168
00:10:46,705 --> 00:10:48,185
Don't just assume everything.

169
00:10:48,265 --> 00:10:50,465
So much for thinking
you are my best friend!

170
00:10:59,105 --> 00:11:00,345
Xiaohe!

171
00:11:05,945 --> 00:11:06,825
Double Stripe.

172
00:11:06,905 --> 00:11:08,345
You peed here last time.

173
00:11:08,425 --> 00:11:10,865
I've held a lot this time. Let's compete.

174
00:11:11,385 --> 00:11:13,945
-You? Maybe after you beat Bunny first.
-Come.

175
00:11:14,025 --> 00:11:15,465
Come.

176
00:11:15,545 --> 00:11:16,385
Ready.

177
00:11:16,465 --> 00:11:17,865
Three.

178
00:11:17,945 --> 00:11:19,465
Two.

179
00:11:21,985 --> 00:11:23,905
Why did you shout?

180
00:11:27,665 --> 00:11:28,785
What is that?

181
00:11:30,985 --> 00:11:32,265
What…

182
00:11:35,825 --> 00:11:36,705
It… It might be a person.

183
00:11:38,145 --> 00:11:38,985
It is a person.

184
00:11:57,305 --> 00:11:58,785
I've never met her.

185
00:12:00,785 --> 00:12:02,425
-Thank you.
-You're welcome.

186
00:12:27,225 --> 00:12:28,385
-Hurry up.
-Hurry.

187
00:12:28,465 --> 00:12:29,465
Open the shutter.

188
00:12:29,545 --> 00:12:30,505
Open it.

189
00:12:34,145 --> 00:12:34,945
Put her in here.

190
00:12:37,065 --> 00:12:39,185
JIAJIA GROCERY

191
00:12:39,265 --> 00:12:41,545
Mister, we found a frozen girl.

192
00:12:42,945 --> 00:12:45,065
Bring her inside.
Don't freeze her to death.

193
00:12:45,145 --> 00:12:46,985
-Come.
-Fine.

194
00:12:48,785 --> 00:12:50,585
One, two, three.

195
00:12:50,665 --> 00:12:51,785
Let's go.

196
00:12:52,505 --> 00:12:54,105
Careful.

197
00:12:55,425 --> 00:12:56,465
Careful.

198
00:12:56,985 --> 00:12:58,225
Careful.

199
00:12:59,545 --> 00:13:03,465
TUNZHOU CITY

200
00:13:03,545 --> 00:13:04,625
TUNZHOU LOCAL FAVORITES

201
00:13:09,065 --> 00:13:10,025
Mister.

202
00:13:10,625 --> 00:13:12,945
-A bowl of noodles, please.
-Sure. Please go inside.

203
00:13:33,265 --> 00:13:34,705
Enjoy. Careful. It's hot.

204
00:13:36,625 --> 00:13:37,505
Mister,

205
00:13:38,025 --> 00:13:40,025
do you know

206
00:13:40,105 --> 00:13:43,705
any unique places in Tunzhou,

207
00:13:43,785 --> 00:13:46,705
or maybe a place
photographers love to visit?

208
00:13:46,785 --> 00:13:48,465
There are plenty of them.

209
00:13:48,545 --> 00:13:49,385
Look.

210
00:13:49,465 --> 00:13:50,985
We have Yongji Bridge,

211
00:13:51,065 --> 00:13:53,745
Sanyi Temple, Zhang Fei's Shrine,

212
00:13:53,825 --> 00:13:55,385
and this, Tunzhou Twin Towers.

213
00:13:56,385 --> 00:13:58,745
-Mister. Can I have some pepper?
-Sure.

214
00:13:58,825 --> 00:14:01,865
YONGJI BRIDGE
SANYI TEMPLE, ZHANG FEI'S SHRINE

215
00:14:17,425 --> 00:14:18,505
Mister.

216
00:14:18,585 --> 00:14:22,705
Any place that is quite desolate?

217
00:14:22,785 --> 00:14:24,425
A place that has been abandoned for years.

218
00:14:25,985 --> 00:14:27,425
What a peculiar preference.

219
00:14:30,145 --> 00:14:31,305
Here.

220
00:14:31,825 --> 00:14:32,945
This one here?

221
00:14:34,225 --> 00:14:35,825
COPPER FACTORY

222
00:14:38,745 --> 00:14:40,065
Copper Factory.

223
00:14:45,785 --> 00:14:49,145
JIAJIA GROCERY

224
00:14:51,585 --> 00:14:52,745
CONVENIENT AND AFFORDABLE

225
00:15:10,065 --> 00:15:11,065
Send in the soldiers.

226
00:15:12,545 --> 00:15:13,745
Bunny.

227
00:15:20,225 --> 00:15:21,985
This girl is so fierce.

228
00:15:26,625 --> 00:15:27,785
Wake up!

229
00:15:29,665 --> 00:15:30,545
You…

230
00:15:31,065 --> 00:15:32,985
Who are you? Who the heck are you?

231
00:15:33,065 --> 00:15:34,745
-Who are you?
-Help!

232
00:15:34,825 --> 00:15:36,145
Who are you?

233
00:15:37,265 --> 00:15:39,585
Stop hitting him. Stop hitting him.

234
00:15:42,065 --> 00:15:43,665
-Get her!
-Bring it on!

235
00:15:45,825 --> 00:15:47,385
Bring it on!

236
00:15:47,465 --> 00:15:48,705
Don't try to mess with me.

237
00:15:50,225 --> 00:15:51,825
Stop!

238
00:15:54,345 --> 00:15:55,585
Don't come any closer!

239
00:16:15,945 --> 00:16:16,825
<i>Hello?</i>

240
00:16:16,905 --> 00:16:18,945
Hello, Dad.

241
00:16:19,025 --> 00:16:20,505
Xiaohe.

242
00:16:21,105 --> 00:16:22,745
Where are you calling me from?

243
00:16:24,865 --> 00:16:26,385
The shop by the school's gate.

244
00:16:26,985 --> 00:16:28,505
It's so late now.

245
00:16:28,585 --> 00:16:29,585
Why aren't you at school?

246
00:16:29,665 --> 00:16:30,985
Why are you calling me?

247
00:16:32,225 --> 00:16:33,665
Nothing.

248
00:16:37,825 --> 00:16:39,585
Then I'll hang up now.

249
00:16:39,665 --> 00:16:41,425
<i>My phone is dying.</i>

250
00:16:41,505 --> 00:16:42,785
<i>Go back to your class.</i>

251
00:16:42,865 --> 00:16:45,105
Finish your homework and eat on time.

252
00:16:45,185 --> 00:16:46,625
Listen to Uncle Ran.

253
00:16:47,345 --> 00:16:48,305
<i>Do you hear me?</i>

254
00:16:50,465 --> 00:16:51,585
Hello?

255
00:16:51,665 --> 00:16:52,705
Hello?

256
00:16:55,505 --> 00:16:57,345
She's skipping classes again.

257
00:17:05,305 --> 00:17:07,224
<i>Keyboard. You're gone.</i>

258
00:17:07,305 --> 00:17:08,704
<i>The band is gone.</i>

259
00:17:09,345 --> 00:17:10,944
<i>No one at home cares about me.</i>

260
00:17:11,704 --> 00:17:12,665
<i>Where should I go now?</i>

261
00:17:17,665 --> 00:17:20,785
<i>If you really want to learn music,</i>
<i>you can go to Beijing.</i>

262
00:17:23,944 --> 00:17:25,305
Go home now.

263
00:17:25,905 --> 00:17:28,385
This place is not an orphanage.

264
00:17:29,145 --> 00:17:29,985
Exactly.

265
00:17:36,785 --> 00:17:39,545
Please don't kick me out.

266
00:17:39,625 --> 00:17:40,625
My dad…

267
00:17:41,145 --> 00:17:42,905
I was adopted.

268
00:17:42,985 --> 00:17:45,345
My dad hits me every day
and forces me to drop out of school.

269
00:17:45,425 --> 00:17:47,105
I'm too scared to go home.

270
00:17:47,185 --> 00:17:49,225
I want to work

271
00:17:49,305 --> 00:17:52,025
to pay for my tuition.

272
00:17:52,105 --> 00:17:54,305
What a rough childhood.

273
00:17:54,385 --> 00:17:55,905
No wonder she's so violent.

274
00:17:57,465 --> 00:18:00,025
Mister, help her out.

275
00:18:00,105 --> 00:18:01,425
She has to work to fund her studies.

276
00:18:01,505 --> 00:18:03,065
That's already tough enough.

277
00:18:03,665 --> 00:18:06,545
Mister, let me help you in your shop.

278
00:18:06,625 --> 00:18:08,225
I only have one rule.

279
00:18:08,905 --> 00:18:10,745
The internet cafe
downstairs is unlicensed.

280
00:18:10,825 --> 00:18:12,265
So don't mess it up for me.

281
00:18:41,305 --> 00:18:42,825
You must be Wan Qiming.

282
00:18:45,105 --> 00:18:46,105
POLICE

283
00:18:47,825 --> 00:18:49,065
So, you found me after all.

284
00:18:54,665 --> 00:18:56,625
I met her through a magazine.

285
00:18:58,065 --> 00:18:59,345
We were pen pals.

286
00:19:00,625 --> 00:19:02,665
We wrote more than
ten letters to each other.

287
00:19:03,585 --> 00:19:04,945
We had feelings for each other.

288
00:19:07,305 --> 00:19:08,465
So, we decided to meet up.

289
00:19:09,505 --> 00:19:10,425
It became official then.

290
00:19:11,865 --> 00:19:13,145
I began to look for a job in Weiyang.

291
00:19:21,265 --> 00:19:23,065
She's a bit color-blind.

292
00:19:23,145 --> 00:19:26,265
So I only took monochrome photos of her.

293
00:19:26,345 --> 00:19:28,905
As time went by, it became a habit.

294
00:19:29,505 --> 00:19:30,305
I don't take colored photos anymore.

295
00:19:31,025 --> 00:19:32,945
Around three months after we met,

296
00:19:33,025 --> 00:19:34,185
she brought me home.

297
00:19:35,025 --> 00:19:37,585
Her relatives were quite fond of me.

298
00:19:37,665 --> 00:19:40,265
Her father was eccentric,

299
00:19:40,345 --> 00:19:41,585
but he didn't say no to it.

300
00:19:42,465 --> 00:19:44,025
Everything was going so well.

301
00:19:58,625 --> 00:19:59,905
Qiming.

302
00:20:01,385 --> 00:20:02,545
Let's get married.

303
00:20:10,345 --> 00:20:11,345
Meng.

304
00:20:11,865 --> 00:20:14,385
Come with me to Guangdong.

305
00:20:15,865 --> 00:20:17,385
I'd love to marry you,

306
00:20:18,065 --> 00:20:19,585
but I don't have a career now.

307
00:20:19,665 --> 00:20:20,945
Weiyang is too small.

308
00:20:21,025 --> 00:20:23,465
I don't want to stay here
doing wedding photography forever.

309
00:20:24,425 --> 00:20:26,025
Let's work hard for a few years.

310
00:20:26,105 --> 00:20:28,385
Once our careers are stable,
we'll get married.

311
00:20:31,825 --> 00:20:32,985
What's the matter?

312
00:20:35,025 --> 00:20:37,225
I don't want a career.

313
00:20:39,465 --> 00:20:41,425
I just want a family.

314
00:20:46,145 --> 00:20:48,065
But we're still young.

315
00:20:49,065 --> 00:20:51,185
We can prove ourselves.

316
00:20:52,105 --> 00:20:53,905
-Do you know that--
-Qiming.

317
00:20:54,945 --> 00:20:56,105
I can't leave my dad.

318
00:20:58,625 --> 00:21:00,305
Can you stay in Weiyang?

319
00:21:10,345 --> 00:21:13,025
<i>In the end, I decided</i>
<i>to head to Guangdong.</i>

320
00:21:13,545 --> 00:21:15,465
We separated

321
00:21:15,545 --> 00:21:17,585
and resumed our written communication,
as we did before.

322
00:21:18,665 --> 00:21:21,305
Then she said she'd wait for me,

323
00:21:21,385 --> 00:21:24,865
that once I earned enough money,
I'd return to Weiyang to marry her.

324
00:21:25,465 --> 00:21:26,745
I said yes.

325
00:21:28,185 --> 00:21:29,425
And then?

326
00:21:30,105 --> 00:21:33,105
After more than six months,
she stopped replying to my letters.

327
00:21:33,825 --> 00:21:35,185
I called her home,
but no one would pick up.

328
00:21:35,785 --> 00:21:37,425
<i>During the Qingming Festival of 1996,</i>

329
00:21:37,505 --> 00:21:38,825
<i>I told my mentor</i>

330
00:21:38,905 --> 00:21:40,585
<i>that I wanted to return home</i>
<i>to pay respect to my ancestors.</i>

331
00:21:41,345 --> 00:21:43,025
<i>But in fact, I went</i>
<i>to Weiyang to look for her.</i>

332
00:22:27,905 --> 00:22:29,505
That's when I learned

333
00:22:30,025 --> 00:22:32,425
that she and her father
were in the accident at Mount Wu.

334
00:22:33,185 --> 00:22:36,425
To treat her dad, she took out loans.

335
00:22:37,985 --> 00:22:39,785
But what I couldn't accept

336
00:22:40,305 --> 00:22:42,505
was that Xu Zhihong
forced his daughter to…

337
00:22:42,585 --> 00:22:43,945
For his medical bill.

338
00:23:06,225 --> 00:23:07,305
Meng.

339
00:23:08,425 --> 00:23:09,785
Come with me.

340
00:23:10,865 --> 00:23:12,425
Let's go to Guangdong.

341
00:23:17,825 --> 00:23:18,905
Just leave.

342
00:23:22,545 --> 00:23:24,585
I don't mind what you used to do.

343
00:23:25,545 --> 00:23:27,465
My career is blooming right now.

344
00:23:28,465 --> 00:23:29,705
We'll get married
once we arrive in Guangdong.

345
00:23:30,625 --> 00:23:33,025
We'll build a family. Okay?

346
00:23:34,425 --> 00:23:35,705
Please?

347
00:23:38,705 --> 00:23:40,665
I gave you a chance back then.

348
00:23:41,265 --> 00:23:43,105
Now, there's no way I can leave Weiyang.

349
00:23:44,305 --> 00:23:45,665
Why do you want

350
00:23:46,705 --> 00:23:48,585
to stay in this broken home of yours?

351
00:23:54,145 --> 00:23:56,025
My dad is back. Go inside.

352
00:23:56,865 --> 00:23:57,705
Go inside.

353
00:24:02,825 --> 00:24:04,665
You jerk.

354
00:24:04,745 --> 00:24:06,985
You dumped Meng and ran away.

355
00:24:07,065 --> 00:24:10,105
I knew you were not a good man.

356
00:24:10,185 --> 00:24:11,585
Why are you back?

357
00:24:12,345 --> 00:24:14,865
What do you want?
To lure her away with your lies again?

358
00:24:14,945 --> 00:24:17,105
Dad. He came back to visit me.
He'll leave soon.

359
00:24:17,185 --> 00:24:18,385
-Move aside!
-He'll leave soon.

360
00:24:18,465 --> 00:24:19,785
Bugger off!

361
00:24:22,185 --> 00:24:24,545
Bugger off! Bugger off! Bugger off!

362
00:24:24,625 --> 00:24:26,065
Do not touch me!

363
00:24:26,145 --> 00:24:27,585
You're a father.

364
00:24:27,665 --> 00:24:30,105
Yet you forced your daughter
to sell her body.

365
00:24:30,185 --> 00:24:31,745
What kind of man are you?

366
00:24:32,265 --> 00:24:33,785
Who are you to judge me?

367
00:24:34,745 --> 00:24:37,345
This is my home. I have the final say.

368
00:24:37,425 --> 00:24:40,185
As long as I still live,

369
00:24:40,265 --> 00:24:42,745
you will not take Meng away.

370
00:24:42,825 --> 00:24:43,665
Dad, sit down.

371
00:24:45,145 --> 00:24:46,265
-Bugger off!
-Dad.

372
00:24:47,265 --> 00:24:49,025
Just go! Dad.

373
00:24:52,625 --> 00:24:53,785
I wasn't willing to let it go initially,

374
00:24:53,865 --> 00:24:56,305
so I hired the neighbor
opposite them to spy on them

375
00:24:57,945 --> 00:25:00,105
and see what's going on every day.

376
00:25:00,625 --> 00:25:03,505
Actually, I was hoping
that the old man would die soon.

377
00:25:05,105 --> 00:25:06,825
What did your informant tell you?

378
00:25:08,305 --> 00:25:09,425
Nothing in particular.

379
00:25:10,745 --> 00:25:12,425
Just that she kept working

380
00:25:14,065 --> 00:25:15,305
in that line of work.

381
00:25:16,345 --> 00:25:17,425
If one place was busted,

382
00:25:18,065 --> 00:25:19,345
she would find another.

383
00:25:20,425 --> 00:25:21,265
And then?

384
00:25:22,585 --> 00:25:25,105
Then, a few months ago, I saw the news

385
00:25:25,185 --> 00:25:26,825
that her father had died.

386
00:25:35,465 --> 00:25:38,625
Xu Zhihong was a selfish man.

387
00:25:39,705 --> 00:25:40,905
Did he not deserve death?

388
00:25:42,105 --> 00:25:43,585
Did he not deserve to be killed?

389
00:25:48,505 --> 00:25:50,745
Do you think Xu Meng is dead?

390
00:25:52,385 --> 00:25:53,665
I'm not sure about that.

391
00:25:55,185 --> 00:25:57,425
But when we were pen pals, I had a hunch

392
00:25:58,025 --> 00:25:59,625
that she had other pen pals.

393
00:26:00,705 --> 00:26:03,905
She is the kind of girl
who likes to be doted on.

394
00:26:03,985 --> 00:26:05,345
She has a temper.

395
00:26:05,985 --> 00:26:07,265
She is prideful.

396
00:26:08,145 --> 00:26:10,625
Girls like her, in that line of work,

397
00:26:11,425 --> 00:26:12,665
will offend a lot of people.

398
00:26:14,265 --> 00:26:16,945
Mr. Officer, I've told you
everything I can.

399
00:26:18,865 --> 00:26:20,465
I didn't kill Xu Zhihong.

400
00:26:22,385 --> 00:26:23,585
And I'd never hurt Xu Meng.

401
00:26:25,585 --> 00:26:26,625
Xu Meng and her father

402
00:26:27,265 --> 00:26:29,305
went missing the day before
the Hong Kong handover.

403
00:26:29,945 --> 00:26:32,385
My mentor took a gig back then

404
00:26:32,905 --> 00:26:34,225
and brought me to Hong Kong to shoot

405
00:26:34,305 --> 00:26:36,185
the lives of the Hong Kong citizens
before the reunification.

406
00:26:36,265 --> 00:26:38,865
I was already away by the middle of June.

407
00:26:42,705 --> 00:26:44,225
I have an alibi.

408
00:26:55,945 --> 00:26:56,945
Zhao Jie.

409
00:26:57,505 --> 00:26:58,345
I was looking for you.

410
00:26:58,425 --> 00:27:00,345
This is the department's
annual budget. Please sign it.

411
00:27:00,945 --> 00:27:02,145
I'm here to report a case.

412
00:27:02,825 --> 00:27:05,625
He Xiaohe, resident of Unit 401,
Block 7, Ward 12, Poluo Street,

413
00:27:05,705 --> 00:27:07,425
13 years old, might have gone missing.

414
00:27:08,225 --> 00:27:09,305
I thought it was something serious.

415
00:27:09,385 --> 00:27:10,865
-That's just Xiaohe being Xiaohe.
-Exactly.

416
00:27:10,945 --> 00:27:12,705
She runs away every few days.

417
00:27:17,265 --> 00:27:18,905
Okay. Report received.

418
00:27:18,985 --> 00:27:20,865
-Chen. Register it right away.
-Okay.

419
00:27:23,465 --> 00:27:26,065
Before she went missing, she was with me.

420
00:27:26,145 --> 00:27:28,305
A good friend of hers
died in a fire in the bar.

421
00:27:28,385 --> 00:27:30,025
She is probably traumatized.

422
00:27:30,105 --> 00:27:31,025
I've heard about it.

423
00:27:31,105 --> 00:27:32,705
The victim was locked in the storeroom.

424
00:27:32,785 --> 00:27:34,385
Someone next door didn't
extinguish their cigarette properly,

425
00:27:34,465 --> 00:27:35,625
and it fell on the carpet.

426
00:27:35,705 --> 00:27:37,105
The fire burned everything.

427
00:27:37,625 --> 00:27:38,905
The victim was called Keyboard.

428
00:27:39,985 --> 00:27:41,025
I knew him too.

429
00:27:46,705 --> 00:27:48,305
Check every location on this list.

430
00:27:48,385 --> 00:27:49,465
Mobilize the officers
with Mangkun as soon as possible.

431
00:27:49,545 --> 00:27:50,465
Okay.

432
00:27:51,025 --> 00:27:51,865
Here. Take a look.

433
00:27:52,625 --> 00:27:53,785
Chen, have you registered the case?

434
00:27:53,865 --> 00:27:55,385
The important information is in it.

435
00:27:55,465 --> 00:27:57,145
-Have you seen this girl?
-No.

436
00:27:57,225 --> 00:27:58,705
Take a look. Have you seen this girl?

437
00:27:58,785 --> 00:28:00,425
-Let me see.
-Take a look.

438
00:28:00,505 --> 00:28:02,145
She's this tall. Around 13 years old.

439
00:28:02,225 --> 00:28:03,385
DRUMS, PERCUSSION

440
00:28:05,865 --> 00:28:07,385
Sir, this is
the security footage for today.

441
00:28:07,465 --> 00:28:08,305
Can you fast forward it?

442
00:28:08,385 --> 00:28:09,105
-Sure.
-Fast forward it.

443
00:28:09,625 --> 00:28:10,825
Let me skim through it.

444
00:28:10,905 --> 00:28:11,825
SUNDAY

445
00:28:14,145 --> 00:28:15,225
WEIYANG PARK, WEIYANG SQUARE
NANSHAN SUPERMARKET, WEIYANG BOOK STORE…

446
00:28:17,305 --> 00:28:18,545
WEIYANG TRAIN STATION

447
00:28:28,745 --> 00:28:30,465
CALLS

448
00:28:30,545 --> 00:28:31,545
MENTOR

449
00:28:31,625 --> 00:28:34,385
<i>The number you're dialing</i>
<i>has been switched off.</i>

450
00:28:34,465 --> 00:28:35,865
<i>Please try again later.</i>

451
00:28:36,545 --> 00:28:37,985
END CALL

452
00:28:38,625 --> 00:28:39,705
POLICE

453
00:28:39,785 --> 00:28:41,145
-Check inside.
-Okay.

454
00:28:41,225 --> 00:28:42,185
WEIYANG BUS TERMINAL

455
00:28:46,465 --> 00:28:47,505
Don't mind me.

456
00:28:47,585 --> 00:28:48,825
WEIYANG BUS TERMINAL

457
00:29:06,985 --> 00:29:08,225
RIVERSIDE MARKET

458
00:29:13,385 --> 00:29:15,265
How am I supposed to go back to Ran now?

459
00:29:17,105 --> 00:29:18,465
It's so cold now.

460
00:29:18,545 --> 00:29:19,985
Where could she have gone?

461
00:29:22,825 --> 00:29:25,465
She has always been
a hyperactive troublemaker.

462
00:29:26,065 --> 00:29:27,865
I'm sure she's fine.

463
00:29:30,545 --> 00:29:32,745
JIAJIA GROCERY

464
00:29:44,705 --> 00:29:45,785
CHINESE CHESS

465
00:29:52,425 --> 00:29:53,505
See you.

466
00:29:53,585 --> 00:29:54,585
Come back again.

467
00:30:11,065 --> 00:30:11,905
Thank you.

468
00:30:11,985 --> 00:30:13,905
Little girl, do you have cigarettes here?

469
00:30:13,985 --> 00:30:15,905
No. Only snacks and drinks.

470
00:30:16,585 --> 00:30:18,545
Can you get me two soft packs of Yuxi?

471
00:30:18,625 --> 00:30:20,025
You can keep the change.

472
00:30:28,065 --> 00:30:29,385
Yuxi is 21 yuan a pack.

473
00:30:29,465 --> 00:30:30,665
This is a huge deal.

474
00:30:31,785 --> 00:30:33,545
Thank you, mister.
I'll get your cigarettes now.

475
00:30:34,865 --> 00:30:36,985
-Look after this for me.
-Okay.

476
00:30:37,945 --> 00:30:39,145
ROUTE 36 TRAIN STATION TO MALL STREET

477
00:31:18,505 --> 00:31:19,345
Keyboard.

478
00:31:20,665 --> 00:31:22,985
How are you on the other side?

479
00:31:24,105 --> 00:31:27,065
<i>Make sure you're practicing there too.</i>

480
00:31:28,025 --> 00:31:31,705
<i>You will be the best keyboardist ever.</i>

481
00:31:34,945 --> 00:31:36,025
Also,

482
00:31:36,945 --> 00:31:38,305
don't be a chicken.

483
00:31:39,465 --> 00:31:40,665
You'll get bullied like this.

484
00:31:58,025 --> 00:31:58,985
POLICE

485
00:32:26,225 --> 00:32:27,865
MOUNT WU TOURIST AREA

486
00:32:27,945 --> 00:32:29,265
A three-day trip to Mount Wu.

487
00:32:29,785 --> 00:32:31,025
Come take a look.

488
00:32:32,105 --> 00:32:33,585
It's our new offer.

489
00:32:33,665 --> 00:32:34,505
Have you heard of it?

490
00:32:34,585 --> 00:32:36,345
Sir. Sir.

491
00:32:36,425 --> 00:32:37,985
New offer, new promotion.

492
00:32:38,065 --> 00:32:39,145
Come take a look.

493
00:32:41,305 --> 00:32:42,705
New offer, new promotion.

494
00:32:42,785 --> 00:32:44,465
-Do you go to the train station?
-Come in.

495
00:32:45,865 --> 00:32:47,105
Sir!

496
00:32:47,745 --> 00:32:49,585
Sir. It has been a few tough years.

497
00:32:49,665 --> 00:32:50,825
Give me a chance. Take a look.

498
00:32:52,065 --> 00:32:53,105
Thank you.

499
00:32:53,185 --> 00:32:57,145
KUNPENG TRAVEL AGENCY

500
00:32:58,385 --> 00:32:59,465
We have a new offer.

501
00:32:59,545 --> 00:33:00,465
Sorry.

502
00:33:00,545 --> 00:33:02,065
New offer, new promotion.

503
00:33:05,465 --> 00:33:06,625
Coming!

504
00:33:08,545 --> 00:33:10,625
When is the next departure date?

505
00:33:10,705 --> 00:33:11,545
Which one?

506
00:33:12,145 --> 00:33:13,625
The three-day Mount Wu trip.

507
00:33:13,705 --> 00:33:14,705
KUNPENG TRAVEL AGENCY, MOUNT WU TOUR
FRIDAY DEPARTURES, 3-DAY TRIP

508
00:33:18,025 --> 00:33:20,545
JIAJIA GROCERY

509
00:33:22,745 --> 00:33:24,625
I bought you an egg each.
Come get your nutrition.

510
00:33:27,065 --> 00:33:28,705
You've worked so hard.

511
00:33:28,785 --> 00:33:31,065
Have you earned enough
for your tuition fee?

512
00:33:34,665 --> 00:33:35,745
Truth be told,

513
00:33:36,425 --> 00:33:37,705
I'm trying

514
00:33:37,785 --> 00:33:39,625
to save for my train ticket to Beijing.

515
00:33:40,225 --> 00:33:41,345
To Beijing?

516
00:33:41,425 --> 00:33:43,545
Are you going there
to study at Tsinghua University?

517
00:33:43,625 --> 00:33:44,745
Little girl.

518
00:33:44,825 --> 00:33:45,665
The usual, please.

519
00:33:46,225 --> 00:33:47,745
You can keep the change.

520
00:33:49,225 --> 00:33:50,065
Thank you, mister.

521
00:33:51,225 --> 00:33:52,225
Wait.

522
00:33:53,065 --> 00:33:53,905
The beer is on me.

523
00:33:56,985 --> 00:33:58,745
I'm a Buddhist. I don't drink.

524
00:33:58,825 --> 00:33:59,865
Thank you, though.

525
00:34:01,585 --> 00:34:05,465
SPICY CHICKEN BITES
WITH SECRET FAMILY RECIPE

526
00:34:22,145 --> 00:34:23,145
Sorry.

527
00:34:25,225 --> 00:34:26,784
He Xiaohe. Is that a cigarette pack I see?

528
00:34:29,344 --> 00:34:30,264
Stay right there!

529
00:34:33,784 --> 00:34:34,905
Stay right there!

530
00:34:39,264 --> 00:34:40,545
He Xiaohe. Stay right there.

531
00:34:40,625 --> 00:34:41,225
YUXI CIGARETTE

532
00:34:41,304 --> 00:34:42,945
She can run.

533
00:34:43,625 --> 00:34:44,625
Stay right there.

534
00:34:45,145 --> 00:34:46,425
Stop. Stay right there.

535
00:34:49,705 --> 00:34:50,545
Stop.

536
00:34:55,865 --> 00:34:57,545
He Xiaohe. Stop.

537
00:34:57,625 --> 00:34:59,425
You really can run.

538
00:35:20,745 --> 00:35:21,705
Let's see where you can go now.

539
00:35:23,385 --> 00:35:24,345
I'll stay.

540
00:35:42,425 --> 00:35:44,065
-Bye, sir.
-You…

541
00:35:53,145 --> 00:35:54,505
1.4 meters. This tall.

542
00:35:54,585 --> 00:35:55,545
Take a look.

543
00:35:59,585 --> 00:36:01,225
Mister.

544
00:36:01,305 --> 00:36:02,385
Zhao Jie.

545
00:36:02,905 --> 00:36:04,265
Captain Ran. Qu.

546
00:36:12,665 --> 00:36:14,865
It was very cold that night.
She couldn't have run far.

547
00:36:14,945 --> 00:36:17,305
Focus on the 24-hour shops

548
00:36:17,385 --> 00:36:18,945
within the red circles.

549
00:36:19,625 --> 00:36:20,985
Let's split up and search.

550
00:36:21,065 --> 00:36:22,025
It'll be more efficient.

551
00:36:22,105 --> 00:36:23,585
Mangkun, Chen. You guys go here.

552
00:36:23,665 --> 00:36:24,785
I'll take this one. Okay?

553
00:36:24,865 --> 00:36:26,385
-Okay.
-Split the workload among yourselves.

554
00:36:26,905 --> 00:36:28,225
Hi, Mr. Zhang.

555
00:36:28,305 --> 00:36:29,265
Hello?

556
00:36:29,345 --> 00:36:30,985
Are you the parent of He Xiaohe?

557
00:36:31,065 --> 00:36:33,025
She didn't come to class today.

558
00:36:33,105 --> 00:36:35,625
I saw her running around with cigarettes.
Will you please discipline her?

559
00:36:36,785 --> 00:36:38,505
When? Where did you see her?

560
00:36:38,585 --> 00:36:39,985
Tell me more.

561
00:36:43,465 --> 00:36:44,505
I see.

562
00:36:44,585 --> 00:36:45,785
Forgive me, Mr. Zhang.

563
00:36:45,865 --> 00:36:47,065
I'll lecture her later.

564
00:36:49,305 --> 00:36:50,185
Xiaohe has appeared.

565
00:36:50,265 --> 00:36:52,225
Someone saw her
buying cigarettes at Nanhu Market.

566
00:36:52,305 --> 00:36:53,905
They even found
bus tickets in her pockets.

567
00:36:53,985 --> 00:36:55,625
Nanhu Market.

568
00:36:55,705 --> 00:36:56,745
Bus tickets.

569
00:36:56,825 --> 00:36:57,985
And cigarettes too?

570
00:37:02,385 --> 00:37:04,585
Check all bus stations
that serve Nanhu Market.

571
00:37:04,665 --> 00:37:05,545
Okay.

572
00:37:05,625 --> 00:37:07,065
NANHU MARKET

